# Repo-root ignores. Tool-local ignores (.venv, __pycache__, fixture scratch)
# live in mapgen/.gitignore and stay there.

# Reference imagery for the source-driven map pipeline. Was committed in full
# via Git LFS as of 2026-09-03 to sync between two devices; reverted 2026-09-15
# once work moved to a single machine (the second can't run the game to test),
# and purged from git history entirely in board #4608. sources/ now lives on
# disk only, untracked. mapgen/SOURCES.md's SHA-256 manifest + mapgen/registration/*.json
# remain the provenance record.
sources/

*.log
*.bak

